title: Triage bundle — stale doc fix + canvas aspect-fit + canvas-size dropdown
summary: 'Three parallel Kits fixed real bugs surfaced by owner testing the media-bin + timeline pivot. Kit-α: sidebar→canvas media drag wasn''t refreshing the layers panel + timeline — server''s ?source=existing path now emits llm:mutation, and the browser WS filter is no longer pinned to project.atelier (latent flat-docs-pivot bug). Kit-β: canvas was width-only scaled at maxWidth=500 — replaced with computeLetterboxFit helper + ResizeObserver, captions no longer overflow into the timeline lane. Kit-γ: new canvas-size dropdown in the toolbar with 4 presets (1080×1920, 1920×1080, 1080×1080, 1080×1350) — creators can switch aspect ratios; inline warning when caption layers exist (re-position is v1.1). Workspace tests 1189→1212.'
